        "AIAH_prompt_from_ES": "You wake up to a chilly morning in the rolling hills, surrounded by dense woodland. The small stream nearby glistens in the early light, and you can hear birds starting to chirp. Small rodents scurry in the underbrush, and the air feels crisp with a gentle breeze. Your shelter in the natural overhang has kept you safe through the night, but you notice signs that foxes may still be lingering nearby. What do you want to do next?",
