                "resource_change": "Edible plants in the immediate and slightly broader woodland area near the rolling hills are now extremely scarce due to the agent's cautious foraging; future food gathering will require significant exploration to untouched areas or considerable energy expenditure. Water availability remains unchanged, with successful collection from the stream. Shelter condition remains stable with no modifications made.",
