ent health and energy constraints. I anticipate learning more about the limits of local resources and potentially identifying new foraging spots if I encounter them during my cautious exploration. Emotionally, I expect relief from hydrating and possibly easing hunger, though I remain wary of my physical limits and the need to plan for broader resource gathering in the future.",
