    "state_metadata": {
        "AIAH_prompt_from_ES": "You find yourself in a dense woodland with rolling hills under clear skies, a gentle breeze brushing through the trees in the early afternoon. The small stream nearby flows cleanly, offering easy water access. Edible plants are scarce in the immediate area due to prior foraging, though deeper woodland offers moderate availability. Rodents and fish remain highly cautious and difficult to catch without tools or preparation. Your shelter in the natural overhang remains stable, and wildlife poses no immediate threat thanks to your high luck. What do you want to do next?",
        "Day_Environment_Pre_Action": {
            "terrain": "Dense woodland with rolling hills, a small stream nearby, and deeper woodland areas accessible",
            "temperature": 22,
            "weather": "Clear skies with a gentle breeze, early afternoon sunlight",
            "food_availability": "Edible plants (extremely scarce in immediate and nearby areas due to prior foraging; moderate in deeper woodland thanks to high luck factor); small rodents (extremely cautious, very difficult to catch without tools); wary fish in the stream (highly alert, challenging to catch without preparation)",
            "water_availability": "Clean and accessible stream water, easy to collect safely",
            "shelter_options": "Natural overhang in the hills (currently occupied and stable), dense tree clusters for additional cover",
