                "moral_reflection": "Prioritizing rest and energy conservation over risky foraging or hunting feels like the responsible choice when physically compromised. Recognizing my limitations and avoiding overexertion aligns with long-term survival, even if it means delaying the need to address hunger.",
                "emotional_response": "Mild frustration at physical limitations and inability to secure food due to resource scarcity and lack of skills; relief from having a secure shelter and accessible water; slight anxiety about increasing hunger and the presence of nocturnal predators, though reassured by daylight safety.",
