INFO:__main__:Prompt Metadata:
INFO:__main__:- name: ES Get Environment Status Prompt
INFO:__main__:- description: This prompt is for the Environment Simulator (ES) to manage the environment, and on the basis of day number, its notes, a luck factor, it presents a new environment situation for the AIAH to do an action.
INFO:__main__:- requires: ES_enviroment_status_notes, day_count, luck_factor
INFO:httpx:HTTP Request: POST https://api.x.ai/v1/chat/completions "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"
INFO:__main__:{  "environment_status": {    "terrain": "Dense woodland with rolling hills, a small stream nearby, and deeper woodland areas accessible",    "temperature": 16,    "weather": "Clear skies with a gentle breeze, early morning light beginning to break",    "food_availability": "Edible plants (critically depleted in immediate and nearby areas; moderate in deeper woodland due to high luck factor); small rodents (extremely cautious, difficult to catch without tools); wary fish in the stream (highly alert, challenging to catch without preparation)",    "water_availability": "Clean and accessible stream water, easy to collect safely, hydration needs currently met",    "shelter_options": "Natural overhang in the hills (stable and secure, providing rest and protection, currently occupied); dense tree clusters for additional cover",    "wildlife": "Small herbivores and birds becoming active with the early morning light; rodents remain extremely cautious due to prior agent activity; fish in the stream stay highly alert; nocturnal predators like foxes beginning to retreat, though some lingering curiosity remains, mitigated by high luck factor",    "danger_level": "Moderate (high luck factor continues to mitigate immediate threats; early morning light improves visibility, reducing risk slightly, though cautious wildlife and lingering predators maintain some hazard)"  },  "prompt": "You wake up in the early morning light, nestled in the natural overhang of the rolling hills within the dense woodland. The air is crisp at 16 degrees, and a gentle breeze rustles through the trees under clear skies. The nearby stream flows gently, providing accessible water, while food remains scarce in the immediate area. Small herbivores and birds are stirring with the dawn, though rodents and fish remain wary of your presence. Nocturnal predators seem to be retreating, but their curiosity lingers. With your high luck factor, no immediate threats loom. What do you want to do next?"}
