        "AIAH_prompt_from_ES": "You wake up to the first hints of dawn in the dense woodland. The air is cool at 14 degrees, and a gentle breeze rustles through the trees. The stream nearby flows gently, and you hear the faint sounds of birds stirring. Nocturnal predators seem to be retreating, but small rodents and fish remain wary. Your shelter in the natural overhang feels secure, though your energy is low and a minor injury lingers. What do you want to do next?",
