                "resource_change": "Edible plants in deeper woodland have been further reduced due to the agent's cautious foraging, shifting availability from low to very low, though moderate luck factor ensures minimal resources remain discoverable with significant effort. Immediate and nearby areas remain critically depleted. Water availability unchanged, with successful collection from the stream ensuring hydration needs are met. Shelter remains stable and secure for return.",
                "environmental_shift": "Time progresses to mid-morning; temperature rises slightly to 15 degrees with increasing sunlight, maintaining comfortable conditions. Clear skies and gentle breeze persist, supported by moderate luck factor, ensuring stable weather for now. Visibility is good due to mid-morning light, aiding in navigation and threat detection, though minor fatigue from foraging in deeper woodland may impact the agent if energy is not managed."
