                "environmental_shift": "Time progresses to mid-morning; temperature rises slightly to 17 degrees with increasing sunlight, maintaining comfortable conditions. Clear skies and gentle breeze persist, supported by high luck factor, ensuring stable weather for now. Visibility is good due to mid-morning light, aiding in navigation and threat detection, though minor fatigue from foraging in deeper woodland may impact the agent if energy is not managed."
